  "description": "A 10 x 10 Crossword grid is provided to you, along with a set of words (or names of places) which need to be filled into the grid. Cells are marked either `+` or `-`. Cells marked with a `-` are to be filled with the word list.",
  "input_format": "Each of the first 10 lines represents crossword[i], each of which has 10 characters, crossword[i][j].\n\nThe last line contains a string consisting of semicolon delimited words[i] to fit.",
